{"unit_id":"Guuu16__dsh-remote#feature-1","repo":"Guuu16/dsh-remote","commit":"a2cb8cd25a0592632670d05192b825f842dde5e6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote 的功能「手机远程访问」：把手机的 HTTP 和 WebSocket 请求代理到本机 DSH 网页服务，访问原有界面与工作区。可用局域网地址，或配置 SSH 反向隧道、Cloudflare 隧道取得公网入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:202-210","src/proxy.mjs:89-106","src/tunnel.mjs:51-67","src/cloudflare.mjs:97-103"]}
